---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Guide d'Utilisation | AuraKadre" description="Prise en main de votre nouveau template AuraKadre.">
  <main class="relative min-h-[100dvh] w-full flex flex-col items-center justify-start pt-24 pb-32 px-4 sm:px-8 overflow-hidden selection:bg-[#00E5FF]/30 selection:text-white" style="perspective: 1500px;">
    
    <!-- Immersive Background Layer -->
    <div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none z-[-1] overflow-hidden mix-blend-screen">
      <div class="absolute top-[-10%] left-[-10%] w-[50%] h-[50%] rounded-full bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_center,_hsla(189,100%,50%,0.2)_0%,_transparent_70%)] blur-[80px] animate-pulse-slow"></div>
      <div class="absolute bottom-[-10%] right-[-10%] w-[60%] h-[60%] rounded-full bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_center,_hsla(271,91%,65%,0.15)_0%,_transparent_70%)] blur-[100px]"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- Container -->
    <div class="w-full max-w-5xl mx-auto flex flex-col items-center z-10 transform-style-3d">
      
      <!-- HERO SECTION -->
      <header class="text-center w-full max-w-3xl mb-32 fade-in-up">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.08] shadow-[0_4px_24px_rgba(0,0,0,0.2)] backdrop-blur-md mb-8">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#00E5FF] shadow-[0_0_8px_#00E5FF] animate-pulse"></span>
          <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#00E5FF]">Configuration Initiale</span>
        </div>
        
        <h1 class="font-heading font-bold text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-b from-white via-white to-white/60 tracking-tighter leading-[1.1] mb-6" style="font-size: clamp(3rem, 8vw + 1rem, 5.5rem);">
          Lancez votre <br class="hidden sm:block" />nouveau portfolio.
        </h1>
        
        <p class="text-gray-400 text-lg sm:text-xl leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10" style="font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.5vw, 1.125rem);">
          Félicitations pour votre achat ! Plus besoin de toucher au code ou de lire des fichiers techniques. Suivez ces 4 étapes simples et illustrées pour configurer, modifier et déployer votre site.
        </p>

        <a href="/" class="group relative inline-flex items-center gap-3 px-8 py-4 font-semibold text-[#00E5FF] bg-transparent border border-[#00E5FF]/30 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-[0.98] hover:shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(0,229,255,0.15)]">
          <span class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#00E5FF]/10 translate-y-[100%] group-hover:translate-y-0 transition-transform duration-300 ease-out"></span>
          <span class="relative z-10">Retourner à l'accueil</span>
        </a>
      </header>

      <!-- BENTO GRID STEPS - 3D SCROLL EXPERIENCE -->
      <section class="w-full flex flex-col gap-12 sm:gap-24 perspective-container">
        
        <!-- STEP 1 : Base de données (Supabase) -->
        <article class="scroll-3d-emerge w-full group relative flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-8 p-8 sm:p-12 rounded-[2.5rem] bg-gray-900/40 border border-white/10 backdrop-blur-3xl shadow-[0_30px_80px_-20px_rgba(0,0,0,0.6)] overflow-hidden hover:border-[#00E5FF]/40 transition-colors duration-500">
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#00E5FF]/[0.03] to-transparent pointer-events-none"></div>
          
          <div class="flex-1 space-y-6 relative z-10">
            <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-[#00E5FF]/10 border border-[#00E5FF]/20 flex items-center justify-center text-[#00E5FF] font-heading font-bold text-xl shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(0,229,255,0.1)]">
              01
            </div>
            <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white">Créer votre base (Supabase)</h2>
            <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed max-w-lg text-lg">
              Votre site utilise une base de données ultra-sécurisée. Créez un compte gratuit sur Supabase et récupérez ces 2 éléments :
            </p>
            
            <a href="https://supabase.com/dashboard/projects" target="_blank" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-[#3ECF8E] text-gray-900 font-bold hover:bg-[#3ECF8E]/90 transition-colors mt-2 mb-4 w-fit">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"></path><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"></polyline><line x1="10" y1="14" x2="21" y2="3"></line></svg>
              Aller sur Supabase
            </a>

            <ul class="space-y-6">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
                <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-white/5 flex items-center justify-center mt-1 border border-white/10 shrink-0">1</div>
                <div>
                  <strong class="text-white block mb-1">Copier le Project URL</strong>
                  <span class="text-sm text-gray-500 block">Depuis l'accueil de votre projet Supabase, cliquez sur le bouton "Copy" en haut à gauche sous le nom du projet, et choisissez <strong class="text-gray-300">Project URL</strong>.</span>
                </div>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
                <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-white/5 flex items-center justify-center mt-1 border border-white/10 shrink-0">2</div>
                <div>
                  <strong class="text-white block mb-1">Copier la Clé Anon</strong>
                  <span class="text-sm text-gray-500 block">Allez dans les ⚙️ <strong>Project Settings</strong> (en bas à gauche) > <strong>API Keys</strong>. Cherchez la section <em>Legacy anon, service_role API keys</em> et copiez la clé avec le tag vert `anon` `public`.</span>
                </div>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          
          <!-- 3D UI Illustration for Keys -->
          <div class="w-full md:w-[45%] aspect-square rounded-3xl bg-[#060608]/80 border border-white/5 relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col gap-6 items-center justify-center group-hover:shadow-[0_0_50px_rgba(0,229,255,0.1)] transition-shadow duration-700 p-8 perspective-inner">
             
             <!-- Fake Copy URL Dropdown -->
             <div class="w-full p-4 rounded-xl bg-gray-900 border border-white/10 shadow-lg transform translate-z-10 rotate-x-[5deg] group-hover:rotate-x-0 transition-transform duration-700">
               <div class="text-white font-bold mb-1">Portfolio_Project</div>
               <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
                 <div class="text-xs text-gray-500 truncate">https://hxy...supabase.co</div>
                 <div class="text-xs bg-white/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-white/10 text-white cursor-pointer hover:bg-white/20">Copy ▾</div>
               </div>
               <div class="w-full bg-[#1c1c1c] border border-white/10 rounded-lg p-2 relative shadow-xl">
                 <div class="absolute -top-2 right-4 w-3 h-3 bg-[#1c1c1c] border-t border-l border-white/10 transform rotate-45"></div>
                 <div class="text-xs text-[#3ECF8E] p-2 hover:bg-white/5 rounded cursor-pointer flex items-center gap-2">
                   <svg class="w-3 h-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-width="2" d="M13.828 10.172a4 4 0 00-5.656 0l-4 4a4 4 0 105.656 5.656l1.102-1.101m-.758-4.899a4 4 0 005.656 0l4-4a4 4 0 00-5.656-5.656l-1.1 1.1"></path></svg>
                   Project URL
                 </div>
               </div>
             </div>
             
             <!-- Fake API Key section -->
             <div class="w-full p-4 rounded-xl bg-[#1c1c1c] border border-[#3ECF8E]/30 transform translate-y-4 -translate-z-10 rotate-x-[-10deg] group-hover:translate-y-0 group-hover:rotate-x-0 transition-transform duration-700">
               <div class="text-[10px] text-gray-400 font-bold mb-3 uppercase tracking-wider border-b border-white/10 pb-2">Legacy anon, service_role API keys</div>
               <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
                 <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                   <div class="px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-[#3ECF8E]/20 text-[#3ECF8E] text-[10px] font-mono">anon</div>
                   <div class="px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-[#3ECF8E]/20 text-[#3ECF8E] text-[10px] font-mono">public</div>
                 </div>
                 <div class="text-xs bg-[#3ECF8E] text-black px-3 py-1 rounded cursor-pointer font-bold">Copy</div>
               </div>
               <div class="text-[10px] text-gray-500 font-mono break-all line-clamp-2">eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJzdXBhYmFzZS...</div>
             </div>

          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- STEP 2 : L'Assistant Magique -->
        <article class="scroll-3d-emerge w-full group relative flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-8 p-8 sm:p-12 rounded-[2.5rem] bg-gray-900/40 border border-white/10 backdrop-blur-3xl shadow-[0_30px_80px_-20px_rgba(0,0,0,0.6)] hover:border-purple-500/30 transition-colors duration-500">
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-500/[0.03] to-transparent pointer-events-none"></div>
          
          <div class="flex-1 space-y-6 relative z-10">
            <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-purple-500/10 border border-purple-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-purple-400 font-heading font-bold text-xl shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(168,85,247,0.1)]">
              02
            </div>
            <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white">L'Assistant Magique (CMS)</h2>
            <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed text-lg">
              Ouvrez votre site dans le navigateur (en local ou une fois en ligne), et effectuez un <strong>triple clic rapide</strong> sur votre logo en haut à gauche.
            </p>
            <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-black/40 border border-white/5 relative overflow-hidden">
              <div class="absolute left-0 top-0 bottom-0 w-1 bg-gradient-to-b from-purple-500 to-[#00E5FF]"></div>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
                Ce geste secret ouvre votre panneau de configuration CMS. Collez ici vos clés Supabase (copiées à l'étape 1), et vous pourrez modifier tous vos textes, images et couleurs en direct.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <!-- UI Magic Illustration -->
          <div class="w-full md:w-[45%] aspect-square rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-black/60 relative overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center perspective-inner">
             
             <!-- Fake Website Header -->
             <div class="absolute top-10 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-3/4 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm flex items-center px-6 justify-between group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.34,1.56,0.64,1)]">
                <!-- Logo Target -->
                <div class="relative w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-white/10 border border-white/20 flex items-center justify-center cursor-pointer group-hover:border-purple-400 transition-colors">
                  <div class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-purple-400"></div>
                  <!-- Click Ripples -->
                  <div class="absolute inset-0 rounded-full border border-purple-400 opacity-0 group-hover:animate-ripple"></div>
                  <div class="absolute inset-0 rounded-full border border-purple-400 opacity-0 group-hover:animate-ripple" style="animation-delay: 200ms;"></div>
                  <div class="absolute inset-0 rounded-full border border-purple-400 opacity-0 group-hover:animate-ripple" style="animation-delay: 400ms;"></div>
                </div>
                <div class="flex gap-3">
                  <div class="w-12 h-2 rounded-full bg-white/10"></div>
                  <div class="w-12 h-2 rounded-full bg-white/10"></div>
                </div>
             </div>

             <!-- Secret Panel Slide Up -->
             <div class="absolute bottom-[-20%] left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-2/3 h-1/2 rounded-t-3xl bg-gray-900 border-t border-x border-purple-500/30 shadow-[0_-20px_50px_rgba(168,85,247,0.2)] flex flex-col p-6 gap-4 transform group-hover:bottom-0 transition-all duration-700 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.34,1.56,0.64,1)]">
                <div class="w-1/3 h-3 rounded bg-white/20 mb-2"></div>
                <div class="w-full h-8 rounded-lg bg-black/50 border border-white/10 relative overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute left-2 top-2 w-1/2 h-2 bg-gray-600 rounded"></div></div>
                <div class="w-full h-8 rounded-lg bg-black/50 border border-white/10 relative overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute left-2 top-2 w-1/3 h-2 bg-gray-600 rounded"></div></div>
                <div class="w-full h-10 rounded-lg bg-purple-600/80 mt-auto flex items-center justify-center"><div class="w-1/4 h-2 bg-white/50 rounded"></div></div>
             </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- STEP 3 : Configuration SQL -->
        <article class="scroll-3d-emerge w-full group relative flex flex-col md:flex-row-reverse items-center gap-8 p-8 sm:p-12 rounded-[2.5rem] bg-gray-900/40 border border-white/10 backdrop-blur-3xl shadow-[0_30px_80px_-20px_rgba(0,0,0,0.6)] hover:border-yellow-500/30 transition-colors duration-500">
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-bl from-yellow-500/[0.03] to-transparent pointer-events-none"></div>
          
          <div class="flex-1 space-y-6 relative z-10">
            <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-yellow-500/10 border border-yellow-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-yellow-400 font-heading font-bold text-xl shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(234,179,8,0.1)]">
              03
            </div>
            <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white">Le script SQL (Tables)</h2>
            <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed text-lg">
              Toujours depuis votre Assistant Magique (CMS), vous trouverez une section contenant un script SQL à copier.
            </p>
            <ol class="space-y-4 text-gray-300 ml-4 list-decimal list-inside">
              <li>Cliquez sur le bouton <strong>Copier le script SQL</strong> dans le CMS.</li>
              <li>Allez sur le site de Supabase, dans le menu <strong>SQL Editor</strong> (icône avec &lt;/&gt;) à gauche.</li>
              <li>Cliquez sur <strong>New query</strong>.</li>
              <li>Collez le script et appuyez sur <strong class="text-yellow-400">Run</strong> en bas à droite.</li>
            </ol>
            <p class="text-sm text-yellow-500/80 mt-4 italic bg-yellow-500/10 p-3 rounded-lg border border-yellow-500/20">
              Succès ! Vos tables sont créées. Votre base est prête à recevoir les données.
            </p>
          </div>
          
          <!-- UI Magic Illustration -->
          <div class="w-full md:w-[45%] aspect-square rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-black/60 relative overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center perspective-inner">
             
             <!-- Fake SQL Editor -->
             <div class="w-4/5 h-4/5 rounded-xl bg-[#1e1e1e] border border-white/10 shadow-2xl flex flex-col overflow-hidden transform rotate-y-[-10deg] group-hover:rotate-y-0 transition-transform duration-700">
               <!-- Editor Header -->
               <div class="h-10 bg-[#252526] border-b border-white/5 flex items-center px-4 justify-between">
                 <div class="flex gap-2">
                   <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-red-500"></div>
                   <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-yellow-500"></div>
                   <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-green-500"></div>
                 </div>
                 <div class="text-xs text-gray-400 font-mono">SQL Editor</div>
               </div>
               <!-- Editor Body -->
               <div class="p-4 flex-1 font-mono text-[10px] text-gray-300 leading-relaxed relative">
                 <span class="text-purple-400">CREATE TABLE</span> public.portfolio_data (<br/>
                 &nbsp;&nbsp;id <span class="text-blue-400">uuid</span> <span class="text-purple-400">NOT NULL</span>,<br/>
                 &nbsp;&nbsp;title <span class="text-blue-400">text</span>,<br/>
                 &nbsp;&nbsp;created_at <span class="text-blue-400">timestamp</span><br/>
                 );<br/><br/>
                 <span class="text-gray-500">-- Run successful!</span>
                 
                 <!-- Run Button Highlight -->
                 <div class="absolute bottom-4 right-4 bg-yellow-500 text-black px-4 py-1.5 rounded font-bold text-xs shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(234,179,8,0.4)] cursor-pointer hover:bg-yellow-400">
                   ▶ Run
                 </div>
               </div>
             </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- STEP 4 : Déploiement -->
        <article class="scroll-3d-emerge w-full group relative flex flex-col md:flex-row-reverse items-center gap-8 p-8 sm:p-12 rounded-[2.5rem] bg-gray-900/40 border border-white/10 backdrop-blur-3xl shadow-[0_30px_80px_-20px_rgba(0,0,0,0.6)] hover:border-green-500/30 transition-colors duration-500">
          
          <div class="flex-1 space-y-6 relative z-10">
            <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 flex items-center justify-center text-white font-heading font-bold text-xl shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(255,255,255,0.05)]">
              04
            </div>
            <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white">Déploiement en 1 Clic</h2>
            <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed text-lg">
              Votre portfolio est un projet moderne classique, ce qui le rend compatible avec n'importe quel hébergeur gratuit.
            </p>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mt-6">
              <a href="https://vercel.com/new" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="group/btn p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 hover:bg-white/10 hover:border-white/30 transition-all flex flex-col items-start cursor-pointer">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between w-full mb-2">
                  <h4 class="text-white font-bold flex items-center gap-2"><svg class="w-4 h-4 fill-white" viewBox="0 0 76 65" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M37.5274 0L75.0548 65H0L37.5274 0Z"/></svg> Vercel</h4>
                  <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-gray-500 group-hover/btn:text-white transition-colors" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14"></path></svg>
                </div>
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-400">Cliquez ici, connectez-vous, puis <strong>glissez-déposez le dossier de votre template</strong> directement sur leur page.</p>
              </a>
              <a href="https://app.netlify.com/drop" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="group/btn p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 hover:bg-white/10 hover:border-white/30 transition-all flex flex-col items-start cursor-pointer">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between w-full mb-2">
                  <h4 class="text-white font-bold flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-xl leading-none text-[#00C7B7]">❖</span> Netlify</h4>
                  <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-gray-500 group-hover/btn:text-white transition-colors" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14"></path></svg>
                </div>
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-400">Cliquez ici pour accéder à Netlify Drop. Vous n'avez qu'à faire un Drag & Drop du dossier pour le mettre en ligne.</p>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <!-- Deployment Illustration -->
          <div class="w-full md:w-[45%] aspect-square rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-black/60 relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-center items-center perspective-inner">
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top,_hsla(120,100%,50%,0.08)_0%,_transparent_70%)]"></div>
            
            <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-8 relative z-10 transform group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:translate-z-10 transition-transform duration-700 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.34,1.56,0.64,1)]">
              
              <!-- Folder -->
              <div class="w-20 h-16 rounded-xl bg-blue-500/20 border border-blue-400/30 flex items-center justify-center relative shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(59,130,246,0.2)]">
                 <div class="absolute -top-3 left-2 w-8 h-4 rounded-t-md bg-blue-500/20 border-t border-l border-blue-400/30"></div>
                 <div class="text-blue-400 font-mono text-xs font-bold">Template</div>
              </div>
              
              <!-- Flow line -->
              <div class="w-[2px] h-12 bg-gradient-to-b from-blue-500/50 via-white/40 to-green-500/50 relative overflow-hidden">
                <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-full bg-white opacity-0 group-hover:animate-flow-down"></div>
              </div>
              
              <!-- Globe / Server -->
              <div class="w-24 h-24 rounded-full bg-white flex items-center justify-center shadow-[0_0_40px_rgba(255,255,255,0.15)] group-hover:shadow-[0_0_60px_rgba(34,197,94,0.3)] transition-shadow duration-700">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="black" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z"/><path d="M2 12h20"/></svg>
              </div>
              
              <div class="px-5 py-2 rounded-full bg-green-500/10 border border-green-500/30 text-green-400 text-sm font-mono font-bold opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transform translate-y-4 group-hover:translate-y-0 transition-all duration-500 delay-300">
                En Ligne (100ms)
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

      </section>

      <!-- BOTTOM CTA -->
      <footer class="mt-32 mb-16 text-center scroll-3d-emerge">
        <h3 class="font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-6">Prêt à créer votre portfolio ?</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-400 max-w-md mx-auto mb-10">Vous n'avez plus besoin d'autre chose. Suivez simplement l'Assistant après avoir configuré Supabase.</p>
        <a href="/" class="group relative inline-flex items-center gap-3 px-12 py-5 font-bold text-gray-900 bg-[#00E5FF] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-[0.98] shadow-[0_0_50px_rgba(0,229,255,0.4)]">
          <span class="absolute inset-0 bg-white/20 translate-y-[100%] group-hover:translate-y-0 transition-transform duration-300 ease-out"></span>
          <span class="relative z-10 text-lg tracking-tight">Accéder au Showcase</span>
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" class="relative z-10 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg>
        </a>
      </footer>

    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  /* Base Entrance Animation for Hero */
  .fade-in-up {
    animation: fadeInUp 1.2s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) forwards;
  }

  @keyframes fadeInUp {
    from {
      opacity: 0;
